flowchart LR
  accTitle: Evaluation and promotion loop
  accDescr: Versioned held-out tasks run against a simpler baseline and a candidate. Deterministic aggregation checks configured gates. Passing evidence supports scoped promotion; failures are retained and cause hold, rollback, or quarantine.

  A["Versioned held-out cases"] --> B["Run simpler baseline"]
  A --> C["Run candidate level"]
  B --> D["Collect outcome, routing,<br/>policy, cost, and latency evidence"]
  C --> D
  D --> E["Aggregate deterministically"]
  E --> F{"Configured gates pass?"}
  F -- "Yes" --> G["Scoped promotion"]
  F -- "No" --> H["Hold, rollback, or quarantine"]
  H --> I["Retain failure evidence"]
  I --> J["Add regression fixture or<br/>revise the candidate"]
  J -. "next version" .-> C
  G --> K["Monitor real outcomes"]
  K -. "drift or regression" .-> H

  classDef test fill:#78909C,stroke:#607D8B,color:#FFFFFF;
  classDef automated fill:#20808D,stroke:#187078,color:#FFFFFF;
  classDef decision fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#C47530,color:#13343B;
  classDef success fill:#2E7D32,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#FFFFFF;
  classDef stop fill:#C62828,stroke:#C62828,color:#FFFFFF;

  class A,B,C,D test;
  class E,I,J,K automated;
  class F decision;
  class G success;
  class H stop;
